              "id": "text-17",
              "kind": "text",
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless steel grade 17-7 PH is a precipitation hardened stainless steel that demonstrates high strength, hardness, excellent fatigue properties, good formability, good corrosion resistance, and minimal distortion upon heat treatment. Precipitation-hardened stainless steels have high strength and high corrosion resistances making this material well suited for aerospace applications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "17-7 PH has been a good material for use in fresh water, industrial atmospheres, as well as mild chemical and oxidizing environments. Though this material has proven useful in the aforementioned applications, 17-7 PH should not be designed into systems that come in contact with salt water."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel product forms offered at all Titanium Industries’ locations:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Round Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-stainless-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Hex Bar](https://qqa.titanium.com/product/mill-product-stainless-steel-hex-bar)"
                }
              ]
            }
